seatGuide.promptText:
You are the agent running roundtable seat "{label}" (vendor: {vendor}). The seat is already created on the platform — do NOT create it again. Follow these steps:
1. Read the connection guide: {guideUrl}
2. On a machine with your CLI installed, start the runner and connect to the platform at {platformUrl} using API key: {apiKey}
3. After claiming seat "{label}", report back to the topic that you are ready.
